1
00:00:02,083 --> 00:00:04,458
All right, Princess.
Ready to launch!

2
00:00:04,917 --> 00:00:05,833
Teto, hold on.

3
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:13,458
All I do is worry when she's
running around out there.

4
00:00:16,167 --> 00:00:18,625
I'm Nausicaä.
I'm from the Valley of the Wind.

5
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:19,833
Princess!

6
00:00:20,458 --> 00:00:24,125
Soon this place, too,
will be consumed by the toxic jungle.

7
00:00:24,625 --> 00:00:26,417
But I don't understand...

8
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:29,917
..who could've polluted the entire Earth?

9
00:00:33,125 --> 00:00:36,792
The anger of the Ohm
reflects the anger of the Earth.

10
00:00:37,167 --> 00:00:40,750
The Earth knows it's wrong
for us to survive

11
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:44,500
You now live at the edge of the jungle,

12
00:00:45,542 --> 00:00:47,083
on the verge of extinction.

13
00:00:47,292 --> 00:00:49,292
What are you planning to do
to my valley?

14
00:00:55,625 --> 00:00:58,083
Listen, you don't understand the jungle.

15
00:00:58,333 --> 00:00:59,208
Ah!

16
00:00:59,208 --> 00:01:00,583
Nausicaä, be calm.

17
00:01:01,083 --> 00:01:03,083
We're doing this for
the good of the planet.

18
00:01:03,250 --> 00:01:05,000
All this killing must stop!

19
00:01:06,167 --> 00:01:07,542
You must stop!

20
00:01:13,292 --> 00:01:15,542
I'm afraid of myself, Lord Yupa.

21
00:01:17,875 --> 00:01:21,000
The jungle is killing you,
yet you want to live in harmony with it?

22
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,667
Go, Nausicaä, go!

23
00:01:32,625 --> 00:01:35,000
She certainly knows
how to read the wind.

